# Product photographs, ~15 MB of binaries kept out of git history — CI clones
# this repo on every build. The images are a local backup of the garage bucket
# (garage-pvc, reclaim policy Delete), not source. The manifest is tracked: it
# maps each file to its garage object key, which is the only record of where a
# photo has to be re-uploaded after a namespace rebuild.
assets/pics/*
!assets/pics/README.md
